---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Legal Disclaimer — ZeroMotion" description="ZeroMotion Marketing Legal Disclaimer - Important notices about service limitations, results disclaimers, and liability. Please read carefully before using our services.">
  <main class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-page max-w-4xl">
      <h1 class="h2 mb-6">Legal Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="text-white/85 mb-8 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        This comprehensive disclaimer outlines the limitations, risks, and conditions associated with using ZeroMotion Marketing's services. Please read this disclaimer carefully before engaging with our digital marketing, web development, or automation services.
      </p>

      <div class="card p-8 mb-8 bg-red-500/10 border-red-500/30">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-4 text-red-400">⚠️ Important Legal Notice</h2>
        <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
          <strong>Last Updated:</strong> {new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)}
        </p>
        <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
          This disclaimer is a legally binding agreement between you and ZeroMotion Marketing. By accessing our website, using our services, or engaging with our content, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by this disclaimer.
        </p>
        <p class="text-white/85">
          <strong>If you do not agree with any part of this disclaimer, you must not use our website or services.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">1. Service Performance Disclaimer</h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="card p-8 bg-orange-500/10 border-orange-500/30">
            <h3 class="h4 mb-6 text-orange-400">🚫 No Performance Guarantees</h3>

            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div>
                <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Marketing Results</h4>
                <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
                  ZeroMotion Marketing does NOT guarantee any specific results, outcomes, or performance metrics from our digital marketing services. This includes but is not limited to:
                </p>
                <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2 ml-4">
                  <li>• Website traffic volume or quality</li>
                  <li>• Search engine rankings or positions</li>
                  <li>• Conversion rates or sales figures</li>
                  <li>• Return on advertising spend (ROAS)</li>
                  <li>• Social media engagement or follower growth</li>
                  <li>• Email open rates or click-through rates</li>
                  <li>• Lead generation volume or quality</li>
                  <li>• Revenue increases or profit growth</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div>
                <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Digital Marketing Variables</h4>
                <p class="text-white/85">
                  Digital marketing success depends on numerous factors beyond our control, including but not limited to:
                </p>
                <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2 ml-4">
                  <li>• Market conditions and competition</li>
                  <li>• Algorithm changes by search engines and social platforms</li>
                  <li>• Client's budget allocation and timing</li>
                  <li>• Quality and relevance of client-provided content</li>
                  <li>• Client's industry and target audience behavior</li>
                  <li>• Economic conditions and consumer spending</li>
                  <li>• Technical limitations or platform restrictions</li>
                  <li>• Client's cooperation and timely response to requests</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6">
            <h3 class="h4 mb-4 text-primary">Service Limitations</h3>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div>
                <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">SEO Services</h4>
                <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-1 text-sm">
                  <li>• No guaranteed rankings</li>
                  <li>• Subject to algorithm changes</li>
                  <li>• Competition-based results</li>
                  <li>• Organic growth timeline varies</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">PPC Advertising</h4>
                <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-1 text-sm">
                  <li>• Costs can fluctuate</li>
                  <li>• Platform policy changes</li>
                  <li>• Budget-dependent results</li>
                  <li>• Auction-based competition</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Social Media</h4>
                <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-1 text-sm">
                  <li>• Platform algorithm changes</li>
                  <li>• Content moderation policies</li>
                  <li>• Audience engagement varies</li>
                  <li>• Organic reach limitations</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Web Development</h4>
                <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-1 text-sm">
                  <li>• Browser compatibility varies</li>
                  <li>• Hosting performance affects speed</li>
                  <li>• Content management required</li>
                  <li>• Ongoing maintenance needed</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">2. Professional Advice Disclaimer</h2>

        <div class="card p-8 bg-blue-500/10 border-blue-500/30">
          <h3 class="h4 mb-6 text-blue-400">⚖️ Not Professional Advice</h3>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Marketing Consultation</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
                The information provided by ZeroMotion Marketing, including recommendations, strategies, and advice, is for general informational purposes only. Our services and communications do NOT constitute:
              </p>
              <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2 ml-4">
                <li>• Legal advice or counsel</li>
                <li>• Financial planning or investment advice</li>
                <li>• Tax advice or consultation</li>
                <li>• Professional consulting services</li>
                <li>• Certified expert recommendations</li>
                <li>• Guaranteed business outcomes</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Client Responsibility</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
                You are solely responsible for:
              </p>
              <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2 ml-4">
                <li>• Evaluating the suitability of our recommendations for your specific situation</li>
                <li>• Consulting with qualified professionals (attorneys, accountants, etc.)</li>
                <li>• Making business decisions based on your own judgment and circumstances</li>
                <li>• Complying with all applicable laws and regulations</li>
                <li>• Implementing and maintaining any systems or processes we recommend</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">3. AI and Technology Disclaimer</h2>

        <div class="card p-8 bg-purple-500/10 border-purple-500/30">
          <h3 class="h4 mb-6 text-purple-400">🤖 AI Technology Limitations</h3>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">AI-Powered Services</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
                Our AI-powered marketing automation, content generation, and analytics services utilize advanced artificial intelligence and machine learning technologies. However:
              </p>
              <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2 ml-4">
                <li>• AI outputs may contain errors or inaccuracies</li>
                <li>• AI recommendations are suggestions, not guarantees</li>
                <li>• Machine learning models require ongoing training and validation</li>
                <li>• AI performance can vary based on data quality and quantity</li>
                <li>• Automated processes may require human oversight and intervention</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Technology Dependencies</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
                Our services depend on various third-party platforms and technologies:
              </p>
              <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2 ml-4">
                <li>• Social media platforms may change algorithms or policies</li>
                <li>• Search engines may update ranking factors</li>
                <li>• Third-party tools may experience outages or changes</li>
                <li>• Internet connectivity and hosting services affect performance</li>
                <li>• Browser updates may affect website functionality</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">4. Content and Intellectual Property</h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="card p-6">
            <h3 class="h4 mb-4 text-primary">User-Generated Content</h3>
            <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
              If you provide content, materials, or information to us:
            </p>
            <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2">
              <li>• You represent that you own or have rights to use all provided content</li>
              <li>• You are responsible for ensuring content does not violate third-party rights</li>
              <li>• You grant us license to use your content for service delivery</li>
              <li>• We are not responsible for unauthorized use of your intellectual property</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6">
            <h3 class="h4 mb-4 text-primary">Third-Party Content</h3>
            <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
              Our website and services may contain links to or reference third-party content:
            </p>
            <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2">
              <li>• We do not endorse or guarantee third-party content</li>
              <li>• Third-party content is subject to their own terms and conditions</li>
              <li>• We are not responsible for third-party website content or practices</li>
              <li>• Links to third-party sites do not imply affiliation or endorsement</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">5. Financial and Business Risks</h2>

        <div class="card p-8 bg-yellow-500/10 border-yellow-500/30">
          <h3 class="h4 mb-6 text-yellow-400">💰 Business and Financial Risks</h3>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Investment Risks</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
                Digital marketing and website development involve financial investment and carry inherent risks:
              </p>
              <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2 ml-4">
                <li>• Advertising costs may not generate expected returns</li>
                <li>• Website development costs may exceed initial estimates</li>
                <li>• Market conditions may change unfavorably</li>
                <li>• Competition may increase or strategies may become ineffective</li>
                <li>• Technology changes may require additional investment</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Business Impact</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
                Changes to your online presence and marketing strategies may affect your business:
              </p>
              <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2 ml-4">
                <li>• Website changes may temporarily affect user experience</li>
                <li>• Marketing campaigns may require ongoing management</li>
                <li>• SEO changes may take time to show results</li>
                <li>• Brand repositioning may affect customer perception</li>
                <li>• Digital transformation requires ongoing commitment</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>

        <div class="card p-8 bg-red-500/10 border-red-500/30">
          <h3 class="h4 mb-6 text-red-400">🛡️ Liability Limitations</h3>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Maximum Liability</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
                To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, ZeroMotion Marketing's total liability for all claims arising from or relating to our services shall not exceed the amount you paid us in the twelve (12) months preceding the claim.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Excluded Damages</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
                We shall not be liable for any:
              </p>
              <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2 ml-4">
                <li>• Indirect, incidental, or consequential damages</li>
                <li>• Lost profits, revenue, or business opportunities</li>
                <li>• Data loss or corruption</li>
                <li>• Third-party claims or disputes</li>
                <li>• Force majeure events or circumstances beyond our control</li>
                <li>• Client's failure to follow our recommendations</li>
                <li>• Changes in laws, regulations, or platform policies</li>
                <li>• Acts or omissions of third-party service providers</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Service Warranty</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85">
                All services are provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, title, and non-infringement.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">7. Indemnification</h2>

        <div class="card p-8 bg-orange-500/10 border-orange-500/30">
          <h3 class="h4 mb-6 text-orange-400">⚖️ Your Indemnification Obligations</h3>

          <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
            You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless ZeroMotion Marketing, its officers, directors, employees, agents, licensors, and suppliers from and against all losses, expenses, damages, and costs, including reasonable attorneys' fees, resulting from:
          </p>

          <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-3">
            <li>
              <strong>Content Violations:</strong> Any claim arising from content you provide that infringes intellectual property rights, violates laws, or breaches this disclaimer
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Third-Party Claims:</strong> Any claim by third parties related to your use of our services, including claims from competitors, customers, or regulatory authorities
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Legal Non-Compliance:</strong> Any violation of applicable laws, regulations, or third-party rights in connection with your use of our services
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Data Breaches:</strong> Any unauthorized access to or misuse of data that results from your actions, negligence, or breach of security
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Business Disputes:</strong> Any disputes arising from your business relationships, transactions, or marketing activities that we facilitate
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Platform Violations:</strong> Any violations of third-party platform policies or terms of service that result from our services
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">8. Testimonials and Case Studies</h2>

        <div class="card p-8 bg-green-500/10 border-green-500/30">
          <h3 class="h4 mb-6 text-green-400">📊 Results Disclaimer</h3>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Testimonial Accuracy</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
                Testimonials and case studies presented on our website:
              </p>
              <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2 ml-4">
                <li>• Are based on individual client experiences and results</li>
                <li>• May not be typical or guaranteed for all clients</li>
                <li>• Depend on various factors including client cooperation and market conditions</li>
                <li>• Are not predictive of future results</li>
                <li>• May be edited for clarity and brevity</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h4 class="h5 mb-3 text-white/90">Results Variation</h4>
              <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
                <strong>Important:</strong> "Results may vary" means that your results will likely differ from those shown in testimonials or case studies. Success depends on many factors, including but not limited to:
              </p>
              <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-2 ml-4">
                <li>• Your specific business situation and goals</li>
                <li>• Market conditions and competition</li>
                <li>• Your budget and timeline</li>
                <li>• Your industry and target audience</li>
                <li>• Your cooperation and implementation of recommendations</li>
                <li>• External factors beyond our control</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">9. Contact and Dispute Resolution</h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="card p-6">
            <h3 class="h4 mb-4 text-primary">Contact Information</h3>
            <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
              If you have questions about this disclaimer or concerns about our services:
            </p>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white/90">Email:</strong>
                <a href="mailto:zeromotionmarketing@gmail.com" class="text-primary hover:underline ml-2">zeromotionmarketing@gmail.com</a>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white/90">Phone:</strong>
                <a href="tel:+19853032016" class="text-primary hover:underline ml-2">(985) 303-2016</a>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white/90">Address:</strong>
                <span class="text-white/85 ml-2">Houma, Louisiana, USA</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white/90">Response Time:</strong>
                <span class="text-white/85 ml-2">Within 5 business days</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6">
            <h3 class="h4 mb-4 text-primary">Dispute Resolution</h3>
            <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
              Any disputes arising from this disclaimer shall be resolved through:
            </p>
            <ol class="text-white/85 space-y-2 ml-4">
              <li>1. Good faith negotiations between the parties</li>
              <li>2. Mediation through a neutral third party</li>
              <li>3. Binding arbitration in Terrebonne Parish, Louisiana</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="text-white/85 mt-4">
              This disclaimer shall be governed by the laws of the State of Louisiana, without regard to conflict of law provisions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-6 text-primary border-b border-primary/30 pb-2">10. Acknowledgment and Acceptance</h2>

        <div class="card p-8 bg-primary/10 border-primary/30">
          <h3 class="h4 mb-6 text-primary">📝 Your Acknowledgment</h3>

          <p class="text-white/85 mb-4">
            By using ZeroMotion Marketing's website or services, you acknowledge and agree that:
          </p>

          <ul class="text-white/85 space-y-3">
            <li>
              <strong>You have read and understood this disclaimer in its entirety</strong>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>You understand that results may vary and no guarantees are provided</strong>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>You accept all risks associated with digital marketing and web development</strong>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>You are responsible for your business decisions and outcomes</strong>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless ZeroMotion Marketing as specified</strong>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>You understand the limitations of our liability as described</strong>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>You accept that our services are provided "as is" without warranties</strong>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>You agree to consult with qualified professionals for advice when needed</strong>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-yellow-500/20 rounded-lg border border-yellow-500/30">
            <p class="text-white/85 text-sm">
              <strong>Final Note:</strong> This disclaimer is designed to protect both you and ZeroMotion Marketing by clearly defining expectations, limitations, and responsibilities. If any provision of this disclaimer is found to be unenforceable, the remaining provisions will remain in full force and effect.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="card p-6 bg-primary/5 border-primary/20">
        <h3 class="h4 mb-3 text-primary">Compliance Standards</h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm text-white/75">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary/20 rounded-full">FTC Guidelines Compliant</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary/20 rounded-full">CAN-SPAM Compliant</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary/20 rounded-full">Business Risk Disclosure</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary/20 rounded-full">Liability Protection</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary/20 rounded-full">Professional Standards</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
